{title: Tum Na Aaye}
{artist: K K Badla Amaal Malik}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
Dard [Bm] aaya tadap ayi,        Ashk [G] aye... yaad [Bm] ayi
Fir [Em] rukte-rukte [A] saas bhi ayi [F#m],        Sab [Bm] aaye bs tum na [F#m] aaye
Sab [A] aye ek tum na [G] aaye [A],        Sab [Bm] aye bas tum na [A] a aye
Sab [F#m] aaye ek tum na [G] aaye [A],        [Bm] Tere bina mera gam bhi adhoora hai
Sb kuch hoke bhi [A] kuch nhi pura hai,        [Bm] Tere siwa sb [A] kuch to likhaa hai
[G] Jane ye kaisa [A] naseeb mera hai,        [E] Takleef he [Bm] mujh ko raas ayi
[D] Tan haayi [E] bhi,        ab [G] b mere pass [F#m] ayi [Bm]
[Bm] Zakham aye... tadap aayi,        Sham [G] ayi.. raat [A] aayi
Phir [F#m] jaagte-jaagtey,        [Em] khwaab bhi aye [G] [A]
Sb [Bm] aaye bas tum na [F#m] aaye,        Sb [A] aaye ek tum na [G] aaye [A]
